  "definition": "Re-Examination After Failure",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-08-05",
  "historyNote": "#8109, eff 6-24-04; ss by #10176, eff 8-23-12; ss by #12614, eff 8-23-18; ss by #13685, eff 8-5-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1000)",
